  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$U=\\frac{f_{1}}{2} n_{1} R T+\\frac{f_{2}}{2} n_{2} R T$\r\n\r\nConsidering translational and rotational modes, degrees of freedom $\\mathrm{f}_{1}=5$ and $\\mathrm{f}_{2}=3$ $\\therefore \\mathrm{u}=\\frac{5}{2}(3 \\mathrm{RT})+\\frac{3}{2} \\times 5 \\mathrm{RT}$\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{U}=15 \\mathrm{RT}$",
